            "review_title": "Review at Bun Bo Sa Te Sa",
            "review_text": "16Anne16\nParis941 contributions\n0\nA MUST this bun Bo sa te sa a real killing!\nMar 2025 • Friends\nA real beautiful place as pretty and efficient as its beautiful owner who is at her second restaurant. This emblematic dish she declined in a “dry” version with the bowl of soup apart. It’s really very tasty and incredibly creative! I really like to discover talent through the dishes, it’s certain we only succeed with love and passion and I’m definitely at the right address! I have only one word: BRAVO!\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten March 27, 2025",
